          },
          "worked": "From part (a), $\\sec^2\\alpha=1+\\frac23=\\frac53$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\cos^2\\alpha&=\\frac{1}{\\sec^2\\alpha}=\\frac35\\\\\n\\sin^2\\alpha&=1-\\frac35=\\frac25\\\\\n\\sin^6\\alpha+\\cos^6\\alpha&=\\left(\\frac25\\right)^3+\\left(\\frac35\\right)^3\\\\\n\\sin^6\\alpha+\\cos^6\\alpha&=\\frac8{125}+\\frac{27}{125}\\\\\n\\sin^6\\alpha+\\cos^6\\alpha&=\\frac7{25}.\n\\end{align*}$$",
